{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:03 2026-10-15 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:03 2026-10-15 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:03 2026-10-15 HKT</p><img alt=\"女工遭切肉機夾手受傷，由救護車送院。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/70355dcf02430dd3429ea8942ea81bd1/2026-10/page1_6.jpg\"/><p>大圍發生工業意外。今日（15日）上午11時29分，圍方2樓一餐廳的一名女職員在操作切肉機時，右手被切肉機夾困，同事見狀大驚報案。現場是車公廟路18號，消防員到場協助女事主脫困，她經包紮後，清醒由救護車送往沙田威爾斯親王醫院治理。警方列工業意外，調查事故成因。</p><img alt=\"女工遭切肉機夾手受傷，由救護車送院。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d9b0c6054bf703f114ec53e19ca51198/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_12_47_23.jpeg\" title=\"女工遭切肉機夾手受傷，由救護車送院。梁國峰攝\"/><p>女工遭切肉機夾手受傷，由救護車送院。梁國峰攝</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/16321c8d9aa379877f337b4740d732da/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_12_47_22_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/d31e220649f74700c3c738ae2a40a8d0/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_12_47_22_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/3f03220a18d0495d9484489042434012/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-15_at_12_47_22.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.367828+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":235,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T05:03:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T08:58:00.211364+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:01.752286+00:00","content_hash":"99e9bf3759ae38a25d95dc750a06d2b6658e056a47319772478d296ae9941f6e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}